MODULE: DivergenceEventuallyRepairedReminderNeverReArms
TARGET: DivergenceEventuallyRepaired
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: The recurring reminder never requests recovery of the work pump.
PERTURBS: Reminder
--- FIND
    /\ pending' = IF phase = "Idle" THEN TRUE ELSE pending
    /\ armNeeded' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: a lost phase timer is never recovered by a reminder.
    /\ pending' = IF phase = "Idle" THEN TRUE ELSE pending
    /\ armNeeded' = FALSE
--- END
